洰鐗涢偅鍧氱‖鐨勫弻瑙掔嫚鐙犳挒鍦ㄥ湴鐢插吔鐨勮韩涓婏紝閭ｆ矇閲嶇殑韬�韬�锛岀珶鐒惰��鎾炲緱鍊掗��鍗婄背锛屽湴闈�涓婄暀涓嬫繁娣辩殑娉ュ嵃銆�", "鍦扮敳鍏戒竴澹版�掑惣锛岃繄寮�绮楃煭鐨勫洓鑲㈡挒浜嗗洖鍘伙紝鍙堝皢閾佽�掕洰鐗涙挒閫�鍗婄背銆備袱鍙�鍔涢噺鍨嬮瓟瀹犱竴娆℃�″�规挒锛岃皝涔熸病鑳藉崰鍒颁粈涔堜究瀹滐紝鍚�鍝у惌鍝у悙鐫�鐧芥皵锛屽緢蹇�渚胯兌鐫�鍦ㄤ竴璧枫��", "搴炴棤蹇屽緱鎰忕殑鍐风瑧鍑犲０锛岄�嗙潃涓夊悕鍓戝＋鍜屼竴鍚嶅紦鎵嬫湞璇歌憶鏄庢湀鍑犱汉璧颁簡杩囧幓銆�", "娌℃湁鍦扮敳鍏界殑姝ｉ潰闃插尽锛屽湪杩欑�嶈窛绂伙紝钖涘瓙鐨撶殑寮撶��鏍规湰鍙戞尌涓嶅嚭浠�涔堝▉鍔涳紝鑰岃繎鎴橈紝瀵规柟鍙�鏄�鏈夌潃涓夊悕鍓戝＋鐨勫晩锛�", "杩欐灦杩樻�庝箞鎵擄紵鎸ㄦ墦鍚楋紵"], "_garbled": false, "novel_title": "腹黑狂女:倾城召唤师", "content_zh": "第7章 要啊！我要！我要要要！诸葛明月一个闪身，将自己手上的食物护好后，瞪着那刘婶：“刘婶，我问你个问题，你回答对了，我就给你吃的。”“啊？”那刘婶的手捞了个空，正不悦，却听诸葛明月这样说，有些惊讶，却还是点头，“小姐，你有事问吧。”“你是谁？”诸葛明月拎着自己的食物，心中冷哼，居然敢在自己手里抢吃的。真想一脚踢飞她。但是，目前还不行！原因嘛……“小姐，你怎么了啊？我是刘婶啊。”刘婶的脸上露出个好笑的表情，飞速的回答完，就又要去拿诸葛明月手里的食物了。“错！”诸葛明月这次可没有再留情了，她的脚再也控制不住了，一脚就踢在了刘婶的手腕上。刘婶的手腕传来一阵钻心的剧痛，接着发出杀猪般的嚎叫声，捂着自己的手腕，惊惧的看着诸葛明月。这是诸葛明月第一次对她这样不客气！“你，是，诸，葛，家，雇，佣，来，照，顾，我，的——下人！”诸葛明月一个字一个字的异常清晰的往外蹦着，“你知道什么是下人么？”诸葛明月把下人两人字的音咬的很重。这个时候，家里的另外一个下人出来了，是一个枯瘦的中年男人。这人，是刘婶的丈夫。当他看到诸葛明月冷着脸在对刘婶说什么的时候，呵呵笑着上前来：“小姐啊，怎么了啊？出什么事了？”“呵呵，是刘叔啊。事情很简单，把以前吞了我的伙食费全部还回来，然后立刻滚出这个家门。我就不和你们计较了。否则……”诸葛明月一脸平静，云淡风轻的说着，只是说到后面，眼睛危险的眯了起来，“否则，就去见官吧。我不介意你们吃一辈子的牢饭。”“小，小姐，你怎么了啊？”刘叔赔笑着，心中升起了不祥的感觉。他狠狠瞪了眼刘婶，眼神在责怪她今天到底怎么惹到了诸葛明月，导致诸葛明月这样异常。她可从来都是不闻不问家里的事的。要不然他们怎么能捞到油水？“你是听不懂还是听不清楚？”诸葛明月似笑非笑的看着两人，“把钱交出来，立刻滚！我明天要参加初级召唤师的考核，你们知道这意味着什么吗？”刘叔和刘婶的脸色瞬间乌青。召唤师！他们一直以为没用的诸葛明月居然能召唤出魔宠了！居然能成为召唤师了！召唤师对普通人来说，就意味着地位，财富，权利……“那个，小姐，我们并不是不想交出来钱。只是，钱……”刘叔心中恐惧，这才想起来，对方可不是一个普通人家的私生女，她可是诸葛家的私生女。没有什么资质，谁都认为她不会有所作为了，所以家族也不重视。但是，现在她却要成为召唤师了。那么一切都会不一样了。“只是钱被你们花的差不多了？”诸葛明月皮笑肉不笑的接道，“我要拿你们怎么办好呢？送官吃牢饭去？还是把你们卖去洪林城抵债？”刘叔和刘婶一听到洪林城三个字，脸上血色全无，扑通一声直接给跪了下来，刘婶更是一把鼻涕一把泪的惨嚎起来：“小姐，求求您，不要啊。洪林城那就是个吃人不吐骨头的地方啊。我们还钱，我们砸锅卖铁也还啊。求小姐您大发慈悲啊。”“小姐，千错万错都是我们。求您放过我们吧。”刘叔也哭的稀里哗啦起来。洪林城，那是边城苦地，流放的犯人就在那里做着最苦最累的活。身体再健硕的人，到了哪里也熬不了多久。那就是死亡之地！所以刘叔刘婶一听到洪林城，就吓的瑟瑟发抖，痛哭流涕的求饶起来。诸葛明月看着眼前两人哭的眼泪鼻涕长流的样子，一阵反胃，不耐烦的挥手道：“行了，还有多少钱，都给我交出来，然后立刻滚！不要让我再看到你们！”刘叔刘婶如蒙大赦，连滚带爬的进屋，交出了剩下的钱，不敢再逗留，收拾了自己的衣服急忙出了院子，头也不敢回的一溜烟跑了。诸葛明月掂了掂手里的钱袋，拉开看了看，皱起了眉头，才这么点，明天交了初级召唤师的考核费用就剩下没多少了。离诸葛家的人送钱来还有段日子。真是麻烦！诸葛明月把钱袋收起来，进了屋。那刘叔刘婶就没想过诸葛明月能去参加初级召唤师的考核，所以自然就没有留这份钱，而是都挥霍了。一晚上，诸葛明月在想着怎么赚点钱补贴点家用。最后，终于昏昏沉沉的睡了过去。翌日一早，诸葛明月起床洗漱完毕，一出门就看到万俟辰伸长脖子在不远的地方等着。一看到诸葛明月来，万俟辰脸上露出了憨憨的笑容，小跑着过来：“诸葛，早啊，你吃饭没有啊？”“还没。我钱不够了，请我吃早饭吧。我要吃包子。”诸葛明月一点没客气，理直气壮的说道。丝毫不觉得没钱是见很丢人的事。万俟辰先是一愣，接着脸上的笑更灿烂了：“好好，走，我请你吃早饭。”就这样，诸葛明月咬着包子，和万俟辰往城里的召唤师协会走去。在召唤师协会门口看到了薛子皓，他正蹲在地上，和路边一地摊的小贩说着什么。最后似乎掏钱买了点什么，然后屁颠屁颠的跑了过来。“嘿，胖子，诸葛，你们来了。我等你们好久了。”薛子皓正把买的东西放进包里。“你买什么了？”万俟辰好奇的问道。“炼金药水，加力量的，很便宜的，就几十个铜板。”薛子皓嘻嘻一笑，把手里的药剂瓶在两人面前摇晃了一下。“切！浪费钱！有个屁用。”万俟辰很鄙视的说道。“买着好玩嘛。反正便宜。”薛子皓嘟囔着，“药效就三分钟，反正不贵，好玩而已。”诸葛明月却盯着薛子皓手里的药水没有移开目光，她在思索着一些事情。炼金师，这个世界上最鸡肋的职业！没有列入三大职业中。炼金师炼制出来的东西，都很鸡肋。比如薛子皓刚才买的加力量的药水，时效只有三分钟。在战斗中根本起不了大作用。但是……诸葛明月皱了皱眉，眯着眼睛看着薛子皓手里的药水，但是，若是自己能将药剂的时效延长……啧啧，那将是怎样一番局面？这个世界的炼金技术比较落后。诸葛明月回忆了一下，记忆中最基本的那些炼金术，模糊记得一些。结合前世的知识，诸葛明月立刻找出了那些基础药剂时效短的原因。“薛子皓，你手里的药水，时效只有三分钟？”诸葛明月开口问道。“是啊，买着玩而已。”薛子皓点头。“那，如果我能做出时效有十分钟的药水，你要不要？”诸葛明月一开口，惊的薛子皓和万俟辰都张大了嘴巴。什么？十分钟时效的药水？！这与三分钟的性质完全不同。三分钟的药效，也就是喝下去，只有攻击一次的机会，出手一次后，药效就消失了。但是十分钟，就大大的不同了。很可能会改变一场战斗的局面，甚至结果。但是，诸葛明月会炼金？他们怎么不知道啊？“你要不要？”诸葛明月又追问了句。“要啊！我要！我要要要！”薛子皓就差跳起来了，“你要是真的能做出来，我当然要啊！”薛子皓那个兴奋劲啊，看的万俟辰一脸的嫌弃。－－－－－－题外话－－－－－－对此章名字想歪的人，面壁三分钟去！", "source": "www.quanwenyuedu.io", "source_url": "https://www.quanwenyuedu.io/n/fuheikuangnu-qingchengzhaohuanshi/7.html", "_fixed": true, "content_en": "Chapter 7 I want it! I want! I want it! Zhuge Mingyue dodged, protected the food in his hand, and glared at Aunt Liu: \"Aunt Liu, let me ask you a question, and if you answer it correctly, I will give you something to eat.\" \"Huh?\" Aunt Liu's hand was empty. Yue, but when Zhuge Mingyue said this, she was a little surprised, but she still nodded, \"Miss, you have something to ask.\" \"Who are you?\" Zhuge Mingyue carried his own food and snorted in his heart, actually daring to snatch the food from his own hand. I really want to kick her away. But, not yet! The reason... \"Miss, what's wrong with you? I'm Aunt Liu.\" A funny expression appeared on Aunt Liu's face. After answering quickly, she went to get the food in Zhuge Mingyue's hand. \"Wrong!\" Zhuge Mingyue showed no mercy this time. She could no longer control her feet and kicked Aunt Liu on the wrist. Aunt Liu felt a sharp pain in her wrist, and then howled like a slaughtering pig. She covered her wrist and looked at Zhuge Mingyue in fear. This is the first time Zhuge Mingyue has been so rude to her! \"You are, the servant of Zhuge's family, who comes to take care of me!\" Zhuge Mingyue said each word very clearly, \"Do you know what a servant is?\" Zhuge Mingyue emphasized the pronunciation of the words \"servant\" very hard. At this time, another servant of the family came out, a skinny middle-aged man. This man is Aunt Liu's husband. When he saw what Zhuge Mingyue was saying to Aunt Liu with a cold face, he came forward with a smile: \"Miss, what's the matter? What happened?\" \"Haha, it's Uncle Liu. The matter is very simple, pay back all the food money you ate from me, and then get out of this house immediately. I won't argue with you. Forget it. Otherwise...\" Zhuge Mingyue said calmly, but when he said it, his eyes narrowed dangerously, \"Otherwise, go to see the officials. I don't mind you being imprisoned for the rest of your life.\" \"Miss, what's wrong with you?\" Uncle Liu smiled, with an ominous feeling in his heart. He glared at Aunt Liu fiercely, his eyes blaming her for how she had offended Zhuge Mingyue today and caused Zhuge Mingyue to be so abnormal. She never cared about her family's affairs. Otherwise, how could they make money? \"Don't you understand or can't you hear clearly?\" Zhuge Mingyue looked at the two of them with a half-smile, \"Hand over the money and get out immediately! I will take the junior summoner assessment tomorrow. Do you know what this means?\" Uncle Liu and Aunt Liu's faces instantly turned pale. Summoner! Zhuge Mingyue, whom they had always thought was useless, could actually summon a demon pet! You can actually become a summoner! To ordinary people, Summoner means status, wealth, and power... \"Well, Miss, it's not that we don't want to hand over the money. It's just that the money...\" Uncle Liu was frightened, and then he remembered that the other party was not an illegitimate daughter from an ordinary family, she was an illegitimate daughter from the Zhuge family. Without any qualifications, everyone thought she would never make a difference, so the family didn't pay much attention to her. However, now she is going to become a summoner. Then everything will be different. \"It's just that you have spent almost all the money?\" Zhuge Mingyue continued with a smile, \"What should I do with you? Send the officials to jail? Or sell you to Honglin City to pay off the debt?\" As soon as Uncle Liu and Aunt Liu heard the words \"Honglin City\", the blood drained from their faces, and they knelt down with a plop. Aunt Liu even more His nose burst into tears and he howled miserably: \"Miss, please, no. Honglin City is a place that eats people without spitting out their bones. We will pay back the money, even if we smash the pot and sell the iron. Please be merciful, Miss.\" \"Miss, it's all our fault. Please let us go.\" Uncle Liu also burst into tears. Honglin City is a bitter land on the border, where the exiled prisoners do the most painful and tiring work. No matter how strong your body is, you won't be able to survive for long. That is the place of death! So when Uncle Liu and Aunt Liu heard about Honglin City, they were so frightened that they trembled and cried and begged for mercy. Zhuge Mingyue looked at the two people in front of her crying with tears and runny noses. She felt nauseated and waved her hand impatiently: \"Okay, hand over how much money you have left, and then get out of here! Don't let me see you again!\" Uncle Liu and Aunt Liu crawled into the house as if they had been granted amnesty, handed over the remaining money, and did not dare to stay any longer. They packed up their clothes and hurried out of the yard, not daring to look back and ran away. Zhuge Mingyue weighed the money bag in his hand, opened it and looked at it, frowning, it was only this little, but after paying the junior summoner's assessment fee tomorrow, there wouldn't be much left. It will be some time before the Zhuge family sends money. What a hassle! Zhuge Mingyue put away the money bag and entered the house. Uncle Liu and Aunt Liu never thought that Zhuge Mingyue could take the junior summoner assessment, so naturally they didn't keep the money, but squandered it all. One night, Zhuge Mingyue was thinking about how to make some money to support his family. Finally, he finally fell asleep. Early the next morning, Zhuge Mingyue got up and washed up. As soon as he went out, he saw Wan Qichen waiting not far away with his neck stretched out. As soon as he saw Zhuge Mingyue coming, Wan Qichen showed a naive smile on his face and trotted over: \"Zhuge, good morning, have you eaten yet?\" \"Not yet. I don't have enough money, please treat me to breakfast. I want to eat steamed buns.\" Zhuge Mingyue said without any politeness at all, confidently. I don’t think it’s embarrassing to have no money at all. Wan Qichen was stunned for a moment, then the smile on his face became brighter: \"Okay, let's go, I'll treat you to breakfast.\" In this way, Zhuge Mingyue bit the bun and walked with Wan Qichen to the Summoner's Association in the city. I saw Xue Zihao at the door of the Summoners Association. He was squatting on the ground, talking to a vendor at a street stall on the roadside. lastly", "title_en": "Chapter 7"}